87 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 72 0 R
/E (Our mission is to inspire the next generation of innovators, creators, and entrepreneurs by demonstrating the endless opportunities available to them in the growing world of technology. During our 10-hour hacking period, participants have the opportunity to meet with mentors and judges, network with fellow hackers, and create a project of their own with the help of our workshop and resources. FraserHacks is completely free and welcomes high school students of all skill levels from across the Peel Region, making technology more accessible to everyone. )
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [3]
